    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [3540, 380],
      "id": "done",
      "name": "Done"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expired Listings Monitor (Apify)\n\n**Why Expired = GOLD:**\n- Owner already tried to sell (proven motivation)\n- Frustrated with previous agent\n- Ready to try again\n- **15-25% conversion rate!**\n\n**Using Apify for:**\n- Realtor.com off-market listings\n- Recently expired/withdrawn\n- Cancelled listings\n\n**Benefits:**\n- 95%+ success rate\n- No proxy management\n- Clean JSON data\n- Apify maintains scraper\n\n**Priority = HIGH** for all expired leads",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 40],
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Why Expired Listings"
    }
  ],
